 to that unit, up to the number of models that unit began the game with.</description></rule><rule id="996b-acfc-daa3-7a8e" name="Airborne Carrier Form" hidden="false"><description>This vehicle may only transport models belonging to Infection Form Swarms. It cannot transport any other units.</description></rule><rule id="13de-c298-0069-ca7d" name="Aerial Dispersal" hidden="false"><description>While this Aircraft is Flying, embarked Infection Form Swarms may disembark normally, ignoring the usual restriction that prevents them from disembarking from a Flying Aircraft.</description></rule><rule id="028d-ba6d-336c-0dec" name="Buoyant Form" hidden="false"><description>This Aircraft may move a maximum of 12&quot; with an Advance order or 24&quot; with a Run order.</description></rule><rule id="d700-03fb-5b37-0bdc" name="Limited" hidden="false"><description>Only 2 Bomber Forms may be taken per army.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="e0c3-19a9-926a-b6ca" name="Unarmed" hidden="false" targetId="2104-2b5b-3e34-17db" type="profile"/><infoLink id="0325-16e4-94db-e291" name="Open-topped" hidden="false" targetId="9f53-15e2-e2eb-9ee8" type="rule"/></infoLinks><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="41d5-fbbc-a804-4378" name="Aircraft" hidden="false" targetId="9cd4-4d03-18e5-5c89" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="670d-6a28-1f83-09ca" name="Combat Vehicle" hidden="false" targetId="325c-588c-4a24-ce36" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="600f-7910-fa5d-30f5" name="Veterancy" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="c9c3-ff0d-9be1-048f"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="5bd6-4f76-57ce-5615"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="be0e-a9ce-950c-adfd"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="c9c3-ff0d-9be1-048f" name="Regular" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" typ